n\nTake the challenge now! We\u2019ll be waiting for you in XOCIETY.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/xociety", "videos": [{"id": 155712, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HWw3LQ8ja20", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HWw3LQ8ja20", "title": "XOCIETY Gameplay Trailer (Short Ver.)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HWw3LQ8ja20/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}